{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_011Cf6KuPLbuaLqniETG3gNu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done! I've implemented the new endpoint following the existing codebase patterns.\n\n## Files Changed:\n\n1. **src/controllers/tagController.ts** - Added `getPopularTags` controller function that:\n   - Queries tags with article counts using Prisma's `_count` feature\n   - Orders by article count descending\n   - Takes top 10 results\n   - Returns JSON in the exact format requested: `{ \"tags\": [ { \"name\": string, \"count\": number } ] }`\n\n2. **src/routes/tags.ts** - Registered the new route:\n   - Added `GET /popular` route mapped to `getPopularTags`\n   - Placed it before the `/` route (important for Express routing order)\n\nThe endpoint is now accessible at `GET /api/tags/popular` and returns the ten most-used tags with their article counts, ordered from most to least used."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1329,"cache_read_input_tokens":31683,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1329},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"db72107b-bee0-49ea-886d-7e22a361b3ee","uuid":"35155e3f-f715-4184-b92b-1173ba84ee90","timestamp":"2026-09-16T02:26:25.706Z","request_id":"req_011Cf6KuNjPYHey3qAbCntx5"}
